<title>ISRAEL: ICTS wins Cypriot security contract.</title>
<headline>ICTS wins Cypriot security contract.</headline>
<dateline>TEL AVIV 1997-06-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>ICTS Global Security said on Sunday it had won a $7 million contract to build a security system for the Cyprus Telecommunications Authority (CYTA).</p>
<p>The Israeli company, a sister company of ICTS International which is traded on Nasdaq, said its system would provide security monitoring for all CYTA installations.</p>
<p>ICTS Global Security said it would open an office in Nicosia to oversee the project.</p>
<p>- Tel Aviv newsroom, 972-3-5372211</p>
